Abstract = {The Pearl River Delta (PRD) is one of the most industrialized and
   urbanized regions in China. The paper adopts the data from Pearl River
   Delta (PRD) Regional Air Quality Monitoring Network reports of
   monitoring results in 2006 and 2007 to analyze environmental status quo
   of Nansha area. The atmospheric environmental carrying capacity is
   calculated to analyze the scale of the steel base and petrochemical
   base, meanwhile; integrating the cross-border environmental impact
   analysis, adjusting suggestion should be brought forward to the
   development scale of the regional key industries so as to perfect
   planning and achieve sustainable development of Nansha area.},
