Abstract = {With the development of ecological tourism, the research on its
   classification and value plays an important role. Hubei owns as the
   ``province of thousands of lakes{''} reputation, which means not only
   the broad wetland area, but also the rich ecological tourism resources.
   However, with the development of tourism in recent years, the wetland
   ecotourism resources development and utilization degree are relatively
   low. According to the resource properties, the classification of Hubei
   wetland ecological tourism resources are divided into natural wetland
   tourism resources and humanistic tourism resources, seven sub-types, and
   qualitative research methods are adopted to analyze those values. The
   results show that development and utilization of wetland ecological
   tourism resources in Hubei are prospect.},
