   exposure of the maize the vulnerability of the maize, and management
   ability for drought disasters were developed by using Analytic Hierarchy
   Process (AHP), Weighted Comprehensive Method (WCM) and Optimal Partition
   Method (OPM), supported by GIS and technology of natural disaster risk
   assessment. The MDDRI can be used to compare different relative
   contributions such as natural and socioeconomic factors to drought
   disaster risk, and the relative risk of drought disaster to maize
   production at different stages of maize growth.},
