   2009},
Organization = {Intelligent Informat Technol Applicat Res Assoc; Indt Geodesy \&
   Geophys; Chinese Acad Sci; Engn Technol Press},
Abstract = {In order to provide support for steering the future communication and
   education on environmental protection in Shanghai aimed at encouraging
   public participation in environmental protection and facilitating the
   realization of the strategic objective of transforming Shanghai into an
   ecocity, an investigation has been conducted on public environmental
   awareness in Shanghai focusing on public environmental concern,
   environmental awareness, environmental protection behavior and
   evaluation of Governmental efforts in environmental protection.
   Individual information and data has been analyzed and evaluated to draw
   the conclusions: the public environmental awareness is yet to be further
   enhanced, for which public environmental concern is the key factor. The
   different factors including gender, educational background, age, income
   and living area all have significant impact on the four aspects of
   environmental awareness. In the end, recommendations have been made
   accordingly.},
