Abstract = {Using the satellite altimetric sea level data during 1992 to 2009 from
   AVISO, analyzed seasonal, annual variations of vortexes in northeast
   Taiwan (24 degrees N similar to 27 degrees N, 120 degrees E similar to
   124 degrees E). The result shows that: (1) Cyclonic and anti-cyclonic
   eddies are found in research area and had significant seasonal
   variation; (2) Cyclonic eddies had five-years cycle in winter; (3)
   Cyclonic eddies and anti-cyclonic eddies often appeared in pairs and
