   Explos Sci \& Technol},
Abstract = {For preliminary investment of pollution levels of airborne particulate
   matter in PingDingshan city, eighty airborne particulate (PM(10),
   PM(2.5)) samples were collected during spring, summer, autumn, winter
   from September of 2007 to August of 2008. Analytic results indicated
   that the range of PM(10) concentration are from 0.045mg.m(-3) to
   0.872mg.m(-3) and PM(2.5) concentration are from 0.023mg.m(-3) to
   0.0444mg.m(-3), the annual average PM(10) concentration 0.162mg.m(-3)
   and PM(2.5) 0.093mg.m(-3). The concentration of PM(10) was over the
   Chinese air quality standard 0.62 times and PM(2.5) over the EPA of
   American air quality standard 5.20 times. The PM(10) and PM(2.5)
   pollution levels changed with seasons, which the concentration of them
   in the winter was high, the spring and autumn next, the summer lowest.
   The PM(2.5) accounted approximately 64\% in the PM(10). The maintrace
   elements in the particleswere Pb, As, Cd, S, Zn, Mn, Cu and the elements
   easily concentrated in PM(2.5).},
