   (ESE 2016)},
Year = {2016},
Pages = {885-893},
Note = {International Conference on Environmental Science and Engineering (ESE),
   Guilin, PEOPLES R CHINA, APR 15-17, 2016},
Abstract = {The paper studied the changes of NDVI and winter wheat yild based on
   NOAA-NDVI data in March, April and May from 1982 to 2006 and winter
   wheat yield of Henan Province, estimation models was established with
   above data, and accuracy of the models were validated and compared. The
   results showed that there was an increasing tendency at NDVI of winter
   wheat critical period, and wheat yield also showed a significant growth
   during study period. Linear models have small errors based on the NDVI
   of March, April, May and winter wheat yield, forecast error is -7.56\%,
   -6.10\%, -2.63\% respectively. Prediction model established with
   different months of combination of NDVI accumulation and yield of winter
   wheat, has a smaller error, the average was -5.08\%. The accuracy of
   multiple linear prediction models based on NDVI is lower than accuracy
   of the model based on cumulative NDVI and single-month NDVI, although
   considering more growth stages of winter wheat. Regional NDVI can
   quickly and efficiently estimates winter wheat yield, but the accuracy
   and stability needs further enhanced.},
