   2011), Leuven, BELGIUM, MAY 29-30, 2011},
Abstract = {This paper analyzes the amount of eight metal elements in TSP samples
   from seven spots in SSPU. The result shows that only three inspection
   spots have reached national level 2 standard, the other four spots hare
   exceeded level 2 standard. This shows that the apportionment of Dust
   pollution of SSPU is very serious and the atmosphere quality is not
   optimistic. The contents of heavy metals in TSP were analyzed by
   ICP-AES. The contents of heavy metals in TSP in Zn > Fe, Ni > Cu > Cr >
   Mn > Pb > Cd.Through enrichment factors analysis: Cu, Cr, Zn and Pb
   mainly originate from human pollution.},
