Abstract = {The wastewater produced from the polytetrahydrofuran (PolyTHF) was
   treated with iron-carbon micro electrolysis process. This paper had
   studied the COD removal efficiency influences of primary PH value,
   reaction time, the quality ratio of the iron-carbon, the quality and
   volume ratio of Fe-wastewater. The results show that when pH value is 3,
   the quality ratio of the iron-carbon is 1:1 and the quality and volume
   ratio of Fe and wastewater is 1:7 with contact time of 90 min, the
   wastewater COD removal rate can reach as high as 95.0\%.},
