   rate measurements in combination with a conceptual model of the
   microbial transformations involved. This interpretation can be done by
   iterative procedures by solving the differential equations constituting
   the model or by the application of a more ``manual{''} method - the
   latter being the topic of this paper. Examples where different
   wastewaters are characterized illustrate the method.},
