   H2O2), a combination of MWL and H2O2 (MWL/H2O2), respectively. The rest
   showed: there exists synergetic function of MWL and H2O2. Considering
   the color and total organic carbon (TOC) removal, the oxidation ability
   of different oxidation methods was that: MWL/H2O2>MW/H2O2>MWL>H2O2
   alone>MW alone. Monoazo Reactive Red 2 is more degraded than
   anthraquinon Reactive Blue19 wastewaters. When the dye wastewaters
   initial concentration is 100 mg/L, treating time was 20 min,the color
   removal of Reactive Red 2 areReactive Blue19 was 99.08\% and 55.57\% by
   MWL/H2O2, then the TOC removal ratio was only 50.31 \% and 0,
   respectively. When treating time was 80 min, 11 color removal was 100\%
   and 94.61\% and TOC removal ratio were up to 58.79\% and 51.85\%,
   respectively. MWL/H2O2 has a good prospect for the treatment of dye
